{"repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn", "name": "awesome-env-config-cn", "desc": "各种开发语言项目环境国内（中国国内加速镜像）配置教程和部分实践经验，包括github.com, nodejs，npm，nvm, yarn, java, maven, gradle, python, mysys2, elasticsearch, php,golang等等，更多正在加入中...", "category": "Discovered (CN)", "count": 32, "resources": [{"name": "推荐使用阿里云镜像https://developer.aliyun.com/mirror/ 包括了各种镜像", "url": "https://developer.aliyun.com/mirror/", "desc": "", "section": "linux", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "备用镜像，清华，推荐https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/：https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/", "url": "https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/", "desc": "", "section": "linux", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "备用镜像，华为，推荐https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/：https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/", "url": "https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/", "desc": "", "section": "linux", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "推荐使用chrome插件 https://github.com/jadezi/github-accelerator/ 访问github对应的网站自动展示加速连接", "url": "https://github.com/jadezi/github-accelerator/", "desc": "", "section": "github", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "华为镜像，oracle的jdk有商业版权，没有最新版本下载 https://repo.huaweicloud.com/java/jdk/", "url": "https://repo.huaweicloud.com/java/jdk/", "desc": "", "section": "jdk", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "官方下载速度不慢，目前需要注册登录oracle账号才能下载(百度搜索：jdk下载账号) https://www.oracle.com/cn/java/", "url": "https://www.oracle.com/cn/java/", "desc": "", "section": "jdk", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "openjdk 镜像下载有很很多，比如清华 https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/AdoptOpenJDK", "url": "https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/AdoptOpenJDK", "desc": "", "section": "jdk", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "maven安装，apache比较良心，下载相关的基本都自带镜像 http://maven.apache.org/download.cgi", "url": "http://maven.apache.org/download.cgi", "desc": "", "section": "maven", "repo": "mengyou658/awesome-env-config-cn"}, {"name": "在此页面下载，默认自动选择最快